# Title: Suspicious Usage Of ShellExec_RunDLL
# ID: d87bd452-6da1-456e-8155-7dc988157b7d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-01
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects suspicious usage of the ShellExec_RunDLL function to launch other commands as seen in the the raspberry-robin attack
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine CONTAIN "ShellExec_RunDLL") AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "\\Desktop\\" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\Temp\\" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\Users\\Public\\" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "comspec" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "iex" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Invoke-" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "msiexec" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "odbcconf" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "regsvr32")))
